{"text": "实验数据会说谎，但Ollie的呼噜声不会。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_01.jpeg", "category": "Ollie祝你今夜好眠", "id_code": "cat_01"}
{"text": "读不懂文献没关系，反正我也读不懂人类。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_02.jpeg", "category": "Ollie劝你放过自己", "id_code": "cat_02"}
{"text": "今日建议：像Ollie一样，把自己包裹在柔软的情绪里。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_03.jpeg", "category": "学习Ollie心平气和每一天", "id_code": "cat_03"}
{"text": "希望你所有的焦虑，都在摸到猫肚子的一瞬间“咔哒”一声断掉。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_04.jpeg", "category": "Ollie请你隔着屏幕摸摸它的肚子", "id_code": "cat_04"}
{"text": "把所有的不开心都塞进猫砂盆，然后用力埋起来就好了。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_05.jpeg", "category": "Ollie治疗坏心情的偏方一则", "id_code": "cat_05"}
{"text": "Ollie从不担心明天有没有罐头，它只关心现在的太阳暖不暖。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_06.jpeg", "category": "Ollie劝你多走出去晒晒太阳", "id_code": "cat_06"}
{"text": "这里的小猫不会掉毛，只会掉落好心情。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_07.jpeg", "category": "Ollie想把它的好心情分一点给你", "id_code": "cat_07"}
{"text": "Ollie永远觉得你是个很好很好的人，哪怕你觉得自己什么都没做成。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_08.jpeg", "category": "Ollie从来不说谎", "id_code": "cat_08"}
{"text": "生活就像Ollie玩毛线，乱了就乱了，反正玩的时候快乐才最重要。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_09.jpeg", "category": "Ollie优美的精神状态", "id_code": "cat_09"}
{"text": "世界上最稳定的结构，是Ollie蜷缩成的那个圆。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_10.jpeg", "category": "你可以像Ollie一样缩回自己的世界里", "id_code": "cat_10"}
{"text": "允许自己和Ollie一样，在阳光里虚度一个下午。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_11.jpeg", "category": "Ollie想邀请你一起观察阳光下的树影", "id_code": "cat_11"}
{"text": "人，今天不要熬夜了好吗，睡觉才是这个世界上最幸福的事情。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_12.jpeg", "category": "喜欢睡觉的Ollie劝你也早睡", "id_code": "cat_12"}
{"text": "人，你看到这张卡片的时候，我正在平行时空的春天里替你散步。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_13.jpeg", "category": "Ollie要与你分享它眼睛看到的风景", "id_code": "cat_13"}
{"text": "所有的烦恼和困难，都可以用一个喵字解决。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_14.jpeg", "category": "Ollie：喵喵喵。烦恼我给你解决了", "id_code": "cat_14"}
{"text": "Ollie不需要你带来猫粮和玩具，只希望你偶尔会想起它。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_15.jpeg", "category": "Ollie：人，你会忘记我吗", "id_code": "cat_15"}
{"text": "把大脑调成静音模式，现在和Ollie一起开始发呆。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_16.jpeg", "category": "Ollie：人，不要push自己了", "id_code": "cat_16"}
{"text": "Ollie不会说话，但Ollie希望理解你的烦恼，希望你永远开心。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_17.jpeg", "category": "Ollie的心愿一则", "id_code": "cat_17"}
{"text": "Ollie熬夜长了黑眼圈，第二天无精打采，抢小鱼干还输给了隔壁小花猫。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_18.jpeg", "category": "Ollie：人，你不要学我", "id_code": "cat_18"}
{"text": "所有的坏运气，Miles会在换挡的一瞬间帮你从排气管喷出去。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/racing_01.jpeg", "category": "所有问题交给Miles就会OK", "id_code": "racing_01"}
{"text": "Miles想告诉你：不用时刻努力刷紫，记得进站换口气。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/racing_02.jpeg", "category": "Ollie：其实是Miles想你多进站来玩", "id_code": "racing_02"}
{"text": "别担心落后，每个人都有自己的发车位，维修区起步也能上领奖台。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/racing_03.jpeg", "category": "Miles投喂一碗心灵燃料", "id_code": "racing_03"}
{"text": "你的大脑需要一次完美的 PitStop，现在开始熄火。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/racing_04.jpeg", "category": "Miles 强制你进站休息", "id_code": "racing_04"}
{"text": "这里没有导航，你有权开往自己的荒野。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/racing_05.jpeg", "category": "Miles会在另一个世界里替你自由", "id_code": "racing_05"}
{"text": "在终点线之前，请务必享受每一公里的起伏。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/racing_06.jpeg", "category": "Miles 的赛道哲学一则", "id_code": "racing_06"}
{"text": "你的每一个微小进步，在Lunch眼里都是改变世界的奇迹。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/dog_01.jpeg", "category": "来自Lunch的全速支持", "id_code": "dog_01"}
{"text": "Lunch尾巴摇动的频率，就是它今天为你设置的快乐转速。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/dog_02.jpeg", "category": "Lunch：人，今天请和我一样开心", "id_code": "dog_02"}
{"text": "别担心，Lunch已经提前把你今天的坏运气都叼走埋掉了。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/dog_03.jpeg", "category": "Lunch是你的坏运气清理专家", "id_code": "dog_03"}
{"text": "你不需要成为多优秀的人，你在Lunch眼里永远是满分。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/dog_04.jpeg", "category": "Lunch给你的满分勋章", "id_code": "dog_04"}
{"text": "接住！这是跨越屏幕的一个湿漉漉的鼻头亲亲。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/dog_05.jpeg", "category": "Lunch 申请与你贴贴", "id_code": "dog_05"}
{"text": "如果你今天只想独处，Lunch会安静地趴在门外。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/dog_06.jpeg", "category": "Lunch 会一直陪着你", "id_code": "dog_06"}
{"text": "所有的课题压力，都抵不过小狗想带你去草地跑跑的心。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/dog_07.jpeg", "category": "Lunch 喊你去草地撒欢", "id_code": "dog_07"}
{"text": "所有的烦恼和压力，小鸭子用一声清脆的“嘎”来帮你化解。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/duck_01.jpeg", "category": "Padel：嘎！烦恼我也帮你解决了", "id_code": "duck_01"}
{"text": "今日份建议：放下包袱，像鸭子一样在生活里开心地踩水。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/duck_02.jpeg", "category": "Padel：快乐不需要多高级", "id_code": "duck_02"}
{"text": "累了就缩起脖子，做一个只有头和身体的快乐球。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/duck_03.jpeg", "category": "Padel教你如何躺平", "id_code": "duck_03"}
{"text": "别担心未来了，请你过来吹吹今天的风。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/rabbit_01.jpeg", "category": "April邀请你去吹吹晚风", "id_code": "rabbit_01"}
{"text": "你的烦恼，我想用我的大耳朵帮你接住。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/rabbit_02.jpeg", "category": "April正在听你的每一个烦恼", "id_code": "rabbit_02"}
{"text": "这里的规则是：不焦虑、不内耗、只发呆。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/Capybara_01.jpeg", "category": "跟 Fifteen 一起发呆吧", "id_code": "Capybara_01"}
{"text": "给大脑装一个“卡皮巴拉插件”，过滤掉其他人无意义的噪音。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/Capybara_02.jpeg", "category": "Fifteen 的防噪音耳塞分你一个", "id_code": "Capybara_02"}
{"text": "这里的空气是恒温的，这里的你是被允许停滞的。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/Capybara_03.jpeg", "category": "Fifteen的心理恒温箱对你敞开", "id_code": "Capybara_03"}
{"text": "“Box, Box,” ——这不是进站指令，这是强制你去吃饭的命令。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/racing_07.jpeg", "category": "Miles 提醒你好好吃饭", "id_code": "racing_07"}
{"text": "“Slow button on, Slow button on.” ——检测到大脑过热，现在强制进入节能模式。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/racing_08.jpeg", "category": "Miles希望你关心自己的健康", "id_code": "racing_08"}
{"text": "今天的脑细胞已经进入高磨损阶段，建议更换一组新鲜的软胎。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/racing_09.jpeg", "category": "Miles提醒你记得好好休息", "id_code": "racing_09"}
{"text": "Miles：如果生活让你 Spin 了，记得学维斯塔潘，在原地做个漂亮的 360 度回正。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/racing_10.jpeg", "category": "Miles：Spin了就画个甜甜圈吧", "id_code": "racing_10"}
{"text": "Miles：别担心，Hamilton 也会遇到换胎花掉 10 秒的时候，你一时的卡顿不算什么。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/racing_11.jpeg", "category": "Hamilton（乱入版）：为我不平！", "id_code": "racing_11"}
{"text": "安全车出动：现在全场限速，禁止内耗，请排队吃零食晒太阳。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/racing_12.jpeg", "category": "Miles：我来带你回到好心情", "id_code": "racing_12"}
{"text": "哎呀，发球下网了……没关系，网帮你拦住了今天的烦恼！", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/tennis_01.jpeg", "category": "Ace希望能帮你拦住今日烦恼", "id_code": "tennis_01"}
{"text": "请接住这颗来自未来的 ACE 球。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/tennis_02.jpeg", "category": "Ace提前祝你毕业快乐", "id_code": "tennis_02"}
{"text": "别焦虑，ATP 排名第一是阿卡，Lunch心里排名第一永远是你。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/tennis_03.jpeg", "category": "Lunch：人，你永远是第一名", "id_code": "tennis_03"}
{"text": "Ollie：人，你每天要好好吃饭。蔬菜蛋白质和碳水一个都不要少。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_21.jpeg", "category": "Ollie 关心你的胃", "id_code": "cat_21"}
{"text": "所有的猫都有一个共同的学术发现：阳光的移动速度，正好够睡一个下午。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_22.jpeg", "category": "Ollie 的博士研究成果", "id_code": "cat_22"}
{"text": "你可以安心在另一个世界里解决你的问题，Ollie会永远在这里舔着爪子陪你。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/cat_19.jpeg", "category": "Ollie 会一直等下去", "id_code": "cat_19"}
{"text": "网球撞击球拍甜区的声音，是这世界上最诚实的物理反馈。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/tennis_04.jpeg", "category": "别忘了多去球场找Ace玩", "id_code": "tennis_04"}
{"text": "跑动，挥拍，击球。重复这种简单的节奏，直到大脑里的杂音被汗水洗掉。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/tennis_05.jpeg", "category": "Ace的网球哲学一则", "id_code": "tennis_05"}
{"text": "所有的非受迫性失误，都是身体在提醒你：嘿，你该放轻松了。", "image_url": "cloud://cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351.636c-cloud1-0g1pkke1764ea351-1418310788/tennis_06.jpeg", "category": "Ace 喊你 Relax", "id_code": "tennis_06"}